  {"id":"cmd_http","type":"http in","z":"tab_command","name":"POST protected command","url":"/api/v1/commands","method":"post","upload":false,"swaggerDoc":"","x":170,"y":80,"wires":[["cmd_fn"]]},
  {"id":"cmd_fn","type":"function","z":"tab_command","name":"Bearer + owner + readiness + dispatch","func":"const runtime=global.get('splRuntime');\nreturn runtime.protectedCommand({headers:msg.req.headers,body:msg.payload}).then(result=>{\n msg.statusCode=result.status||(result.ok?202:400);msg.payload=result;\n const outbox=global.get('splOutbox')||[];const mqtt=[];while(outbox.length){const item=outbox.shift();mqtt.push({topic:item.topic,payload:JSON.stringify(item.payload),retain:false,qos:0});}\n node.send([msg,mqtt.length?mqtt:null]);return null;\n});","outputs":2,"noerr":0,"initialize":"","finalize":"","libs":[],"x":500,"y":80,"wires":[["cmd_response"],["mqtt_out_link"]]},
